Why Do I Cut Myself?
“Every time I cut myself, ” says a girl named Jerrine,“ I became almost unaware of my surroundings, and I imagined that I wouldn’t have to deal with my problems. ”
Self - injury is a problem for many young people.
Why?
Is it just a fad?
