For that reason, we have no objection ​ — as do some creationists — ​ to credible scientific research that indicates the earth may be billions of years old.
The New World Translation has another distinction: It is distributed without charge.
As a result, millions are able to read the Bible in their mother tongue.
The New World Translation is now available in some 130 languages.
You can even read it online at www.jw.org.
