Purpose of Study Articles
Study Articles 1, 2 PAGES 7 - 15
Four kings of Judah were outstanding for their zealous support of true worship.
What can we learn about them in connection with our zeal as we serve Jehovah? These two articles will prove to be fascinating and instructive.
Study Article 3 PAGES 16 - 20
