Purpose of Study Articles
Study Article 1 PAGES 3 - 7
Jehovah invites all his servants to seek treasures of incomparable value that are “carefully concealed in ” Christ.
What are these treasures?
How can we find them? How do they benefit us?
This article can help us to find the answers.
Study Article 2 PAGES 7 - 11
From the time of creation, Jesus has been deeply interested in the well - being of humans.
This article considers how the teachings of Jesus and the example he set while on earth can help all of us to enjoy good relationships with family members.
Study Articles 3, 4 PAGES 15 - 23
What made Jesus an effective teacher?

Above all, he loved Jehovah, he loved people, and he loved the message he preached.
Love moved him to preach with boldness even in the face of opposition.
These articles will discuss how we can imitate Jesus and be both loving teachers and bold preachers.
ALSO IN THIS ISSUE:
Do You Follow the “Surpassing Way ” of Love?
