Purpose of Study Articles
Study Articles 1 - 3 PAGES 3 - 16
The Scriptural basis for the hope of everlasting life on earth is presented in these articles. They will bolster your faith in this hope that sets true Christians apart from Christendom.
In turn, such faith can give you a joyful outlook and fill you with courage to speak about your hope.
Study Article 4 PAGES 18 - 22
This article discusses three ways in which we can keep ourselves in God’s love.
We can do so (1) by loving those whom Jehovah loves, (2) by showing respect for authority, and (3) by striving to remain clean in Jehovah’s eyes.
