Purpose of Study Articles
STUDY ARTICLES 1 - 3 PAGES 5 - 18
These articles discuss the part holy spirit plays in our ministry.
They show how being directed by God’s spirit helps us to speak with boldness, teach with skill, and preach with constancy.
STUDY ARTICLE 4 PAGES 24 - 28
Doing Jehovah’s will and listening to Jesus is the best way of life.
This article draws attention to specific blessings enjoyed by those who dedicate themselves to God and get baptized.
It also points out what we must do to stick to the truth.
