Purpose of Study Articles
STUDY ARTICLES 1, 2 PAGES 8 - 17
The first study article shows how important it is for men to be in subjection to their Head, the Christ, and to imitate him in their dealings with others.
The second article explains how Christian women should view the statement: “The head of a woman is the man. ”
STUDY ARTICLES 3, 4 PAGES 24 - 32
