Purpose of Study Articles
STUDY ARTICLE 1 PAGES 3 - 7
Where can we find refuge at this critical time?
God’s Word explains that we can take refuge in the name of Jehovah.
This article considers how we can find protection both now and when “the great day of Jehovah ” strikes.
This discussion highlights the yeartext for 2011.
