Why not?
Most Jews today keep the Passover on Nisan 15, believing that the command at Exodus 12: 6 points to that date. (See The Watchtower of February 15, 1990, page 14.)
But Jesus celebrated it on Nisan 14 in harmony with what was stated in the Mosaic Law.
