Some experience a more serious condition known as postpartum depression.
For information about how to identify and deal with this challenge, see the articles “I Won My Battle With Postpartum Depression, ” in the July 22, 2002, issue of Awake!
and “Understanding Postpartum Depression, ” in the June 8, 2003, issue of Awake!

