17 Losing a Father ​ — Finding a Father
COVER: Using What Does the Bible Really Teach?
two sisters witness to two Ndebele women who are dressed in their traditional clothing. They are sitting in front of a typical rural home.
The Ndebele people make up just 2 percent of the country’s population
